prefork-packages (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu repository package.
  * Detect distro at install-time and configure exactly one APT repo.
  * Embed signing key statically in package payload.
  * Switch embedded repo key to Pulp signing key used by APT repository.
  * Configure APT with signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/prefork-packages.asc.
  * Fix postrm cleanup path for keyring file to match installed location.

